          "instruction": "Prepare the tofu:"
        },
        {
          "step_number": 2,
          "title": "Step 2",
          "instruction": "Drain the tofu and gently remove it from its packaging onto a large plate. Carefully slice the tofu into 1/2-inch slabs widthwise. With the palm of your hands, gently push the sliced tofu sidewise so that they fan out over the plate."
